# ── ENTERED THE POPULATION WHEN THE SELECTOR WAS FIXED (your-org/nexus-code#864)
#
# These 25 suites were NOT newly written and NOT newly unguarded. They were
# invisible to the guard, because the selector grepped each file for the
# literal `ALL TESTS PASSED` and these route their footer through
# `th_summary_and_exit` — so the HELPER prints the banner and their own bytes
# never carry it. Adopting the shared helper, which this manifest's own remedy
# text prescribes, REMOVED a suite from the guard. Their absence was
# indistinguishable from compliance.
